* Bio voter-stake-registry
** spl-governance add-in
*** Writes VoterWeightRecord, no CPI to governance
*** Record expires after one slot
*** update_voter_weight_record before each vote
** Accounts
*** Registrar (realm, up to 4 voting mints)
*** Voter PDA (32 deposit entries)
*** Vault = ATA owned by the Voter PDA
*** TokenOwnerRecord checked on withdraw
** Vote weight
*** baseline factor x deposited
*** + lockup bonus x locked x min(t/T_sat, 1)
*** Factors in 1e-9 units, digit_shift per mint
** Lockup kinds
*** None, Daily, Monthly, Cliff, Constant
*** Strictness never decreases
*** Up to 200 years, start up to 100 years ahead
** Grants and clawback
*** grant by realm, mint or voter authority
*** clawback of locked tokens only
*** Ignores active proposals on purpose
** Bio changes
*** Squads V4 allowed to create voters via CPI
*** Anchor 0.31.1, Solana 2.2.1
*** Pod-safe u8 flags, borsh record wrapper
@endmindmap
